<mxCell id="n18" value="oci_identity_domain_replication_to_region.replicas&lt;br&gt;replica_regions=[] by default&lt;br&gt;One resource per selected region, only if domain creation is enabled.&lt;br&gt;Replica locations TBC; no region is assumed." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#759C6C;fontColor=#161513;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n17"><mxGeometry x="30.00" y="190.00" width="790.00" height="220.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No identity domain or replicas. Supply approved admin, license, home-region and compartment inputs before enabling creation.&lt;br&gt;No users, groups, apps, federation, login policy or workload access is configured by these two resources.&lt;br&gt;The license value shown is an input default, not a cost or licensing assessment. Replication arrows are configuration dependencies, not tested availability." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1000.00" width="2360.00" height="130.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" value="Arrows describe dependencies / configuration, not application traffic or a validated security outcome.&lt;br&gt;Source review: 2026-10-28. No cloud resources created, no new provider validation, compliance audit or enforcement test.&lt;br&gt;Deployment regions, parent compartment, org and environment are operator inputs. Historical validation dates are unchanged." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1165.00" width="2360.00" height="80.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="Conditional re